'''Lazarus''' is a [[character]] unlocked by having four or more {{E|Soul Heart}}s or {{E|Black Heart}}s at once in one run. He starts with 3 [[Red Heart container]]s and an unidentified [[pill]].

{{dlc|a+}} Lazarus also starts with {{i|Anemic}} after the [[Backasswards]] challenge is completed. Additionally, Lazarus Risen's Anemic effect is permanent and always active.

Once per {{dlcalt|run|r=floor}}, Lazarus has the ability to revive himself as Lazarus Risen.

