== Trivia ==
* Lazarus is a reference to [[wikipedia:Lazarus of Bethany|Lazarus of Bethany]]. In the Bible, Lazarus of Bethany was resurrected by Jesus 4 days after his death. This is why Lazarus spawns with 1 extra life.
* Lazarus Risen's transition screen portrait depicts him crying blood, rather than normal tears.
* If a co-op baby joins in and takes a red heart from Lazarus, then Lazarus dies and gets revived, the co-op player can leave to grant Lazarus Risen an extra heart container.
* If the player dies as Lazarus Risen, his signature on [[Isaac's last will]] will have blood drops on it.
* Lazarus's locked icon shows him bound in chains.
** He shares this trait with {{C|Magdalene}}, {{C|Cain}}, {{C|Samson}}, {{C|Eve}}, {{C|Bethany|r}}, and {{C|Jacob and Esau|r}}.
** He incorrectly uses his pre-Repentance design on his locked icon.
* Lazarus's locked icon, as well as Lazarus Risen being covered in rags, are references to the biblical Lazarus, who “came forth, bound hand and foot with graveclothes: and his face was bound about with a napkin” (John 11:44) when he was resurrected.

